    Bug 1961106 - Get rid of sync version of EnigmailKeyRing.importKey() in favor of the async version. r=kaie

    Also adding some tags to allow easier running of all the openpgp tests like

    ```
    ./mach xpcshell-test --tag=openpgp comm/
    ./mach mochitest --headless --tag=openpgp comm/
    ```

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D246738

